          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Despara has already secured the Runestones of Plumeria and Salineas, and her next target is the Kingdom of Snow. Catra, accompanied by her squad and Scorpia, is ordered to infiltrate the Princess Ball and steal the stone without leaving a trace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission seems straightforwardâ€¦ until a princess whoâ€™s a little too bright and a little too curious turns the whole plan into a frozen labyrinth of complications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This short story is part of the Despara AU by ilikeyoucatradora.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
